# Medi Canopy — Cursor Rules

## Project

Cannabis information hub: Angular frontend + FastAPI backend + Python agents.

## Code style

- Python: type hints, module docstrings
- TypeScript: strict mode, standalone Angular components
- Minimal diffs; match existing patterns

## Secrets

- Never commit real credentials
- Use `debt.txt` locally (gitignored)
- Agents use `LLM_PROVIDER=placeholder` until keys are set

## Content policy

- Agents do NOT auto-publish
- All agent output goes to review queue or email digest

